0-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The running author-hosted game after start and ordinary direction-key basket movement.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/word-rain-chatgpt.webp","alt","Word Rain in play, with falling letter tiles, a basket, target word, score, hearts, shield and speed indicators.","https://octopuskid.github.io/word-rain/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[87,88],"ChatGPT","Codex","links","相关资源",[94],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":95,"_25":96},"OpenAI Codex","/zh/resources/codex/","创作者开发记录",[100],"evidence",{"_62":101,"_25":102,"_103":104},"Read the author’s ChatGPT/Codex disclosure","https://octopuskid.itch.io/word-rain","note","The author explicitly credits ChatGPT/Codex for code and interface text, retaining design and refinement. The repository also links a behind-the-scenes development video. No exact model version is specified.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[109],{"_62":110,"_25":111,"_103":112},"Open the complete browser and Android project","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain","Complete index.html, game handwriting font, bundled recordings and audio credits, plus Android Java/WebView source and packaging scripts. Open the HTML with assets/music intact; the original generated tune works without those two recordings. Code, original font, tune and synthesized effects are MIT; Kevin MacLeod recordings are CC BY 4.0. See android/README.md for Android builds.","更多游玩入口",[116,117],"distribution",{"_62":121,"_25":75,"_103":122},{"_62":118,"_25":119,"_103":120},"GitHub Releases","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain/releases/tag/v1.5.3","Download — Version 1.5.3, published 19 October 2026: Full/Lite Android APKs, self-contained Lite HTML/ZIP and the complete offline browser ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Release page and Lite APK/ZIP HTTP endpoints returned 200; installation was not tested.","GitHub Pages","Browser play — Alternative author-hosted browser edition; normal start, moving letters and direction-key basket controls were checked.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[128],{"_62":129,"_25":102,"_103":130},"Play Word Rain on itch.io","Free browser game with keyboard, drag and touch controls; an alternative browser build is linked on GitHub Pages. The store and GitHub Releases also offer Full/Lite Android APKs and an offline Lite HTML ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Browser start, moving letters and basket controls were checked; APK installation and a complete scoring run were not tested.","游戏平台","itch.io","指南形式","quickstart","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[138],{"_62":139,"_25":140,"_103":-7},"Read the creator’s source and run guide","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain#run-the-game","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[145,146,147,148],"启动网页游戏，用方向键、A/D 或拖动操作篮子。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，对比浏览器和 Android 版本。","保留 assets/music 目录打开 index.html，或下载独立 Lite 版本在离线浏览器运行。","在 Canvas 游戏中跟踪字母生成、接取、护盾和计分逻辑，修改规则前检查暂停与继续。","AI 工作流与开发背景","octopuskid 负责设计和打磨，ChatGPT/Codex 辅助代码及界面文本。原创旋律与音效通过代码合成，也有 ChatGPT 协助；两首可选 Kevin MacLeod 录音单独署名，并非 AI 生成音乐。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Canvas 2D · JavaScript · DOM/CSS UI","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",{"_62":139,"_25":140,"_17":134},{"_62":129,"_25":102,"_17":124,"_103":130},{"_62":110,"_25":111,"_180":181,"_103":112},{"_62":101,"_25":102,"_103":104},[179],[173,174],{"_175":121,"_25":75,"_17":124,"_103":178},{"_175":118,"_25":119,"_17":176,"_103":177},"platform","download","Version 1.5.3, published 19 October 2026: Full/Lite Android APKs, self-contained Lite HTML/ZIP and the complete offline browser ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Release page and Lite APK/ZIP HTTP endpoints returned 200; installation was not tested.","Alternative author-hosted browser edition; normal start, moving letters and direction-key basket controls were checked.","codex","scope","complete-project",{"_183":184},"documents",{"_67":185,"_35":186},[188,192,193,194,191,195,196,197,198,199,